=== login
--- calls
exit: 0
--- stdout
--- stderr
refdata: no-op. No provider has a session to mint.
To probe each enabled provider, run `wealthdb-collect refdata login --check`.
=== download
--- calls
python3
  <TMP>/w-refdata/tree/collectors/refdata/download.py
  --bronze-dir
  <TMP>/w-refdata/xdgdata/wealthdb/refdata
  [env] GOLDEN_ENV_FILE=invented-refdata
  [env] GOLDEN_FINRA=invented-finra
exit: 0
